  "scope": "Generic ordered real closed field Sturm\u2013Tarski and finite BKR moment inversion/whole-line sign realizability. No quantifier elimination imported. Source unchanged. Compilation only so far; not yet accepted as repository source.",
  "audit_notes": [
    "The QuantifierElimination file at this revision assumes projection closure and cannot supply it.",
    "Current main b0afcaa7ea7c9debf20bad5dcaf790bcff851afb has unconditional real projection via CAD.Existence, but its QE allows new arbitrary real parameters and is existential, not executable rational-coefficient elimination. Its toolchain is4.36.0-rc2.",
